# Hama, the Bloodbender: "Exile up to one noncreature, nonland card from that player's graveyard." Bot2 mills Shock, Ornithopter and
# Lightning Bolt: two noncreature, nonland cards and a creature card. The Ornithopter cannot be chosen, nor can more than one card, and
# choosing only the Shock leaves the Bolt in the graveyard (fewer than the most is not the same as all). Only the exiled card is cast.

